# ⚠️ Without this, `docker build` sends the whole working tree to the daemon as build
# context -- measured here at **82 GB**, almost all of it `target/`, which made a
# `scripts/byoc.sh` run time out before the compiler had started. None of it is used: both
# Dockerfiles `COPY . .` and then build from source inside the image.
target/
mutants.out/
.git/
